  "title": "Webmin 2.651 and Usermin 2.550 released",
  "summary": "Howdy all, We’ve rolled out Webmin 2.651 and Usermin 2.550 to all Virtualmin repos. Changes since Webmin 2.650: Fix Certbot-backed certificate requests and renewals to correctly parse PEM paths after issuance Fix live activation of Linux bond interfaces #2777 Update the Authentic theme to the latest version with various improvements and fixes: Fix search-result all-items delete in File Manager Fix search-result delete ordering in File Manager Fix to speed up search-result deletion cleanup i...",
